mh2lm: add gated read-only PM8150B charge diagnostics (0120)

0112m14 proves that USB VBUS is detected and the iOS battery UI consumes the
published source, but SMB5 reports state 7 (DISABLE_CHARGE).  Add an explicit
sweetbattdiag=1 probe to log only the relevant charger gates and a stable
IBATT/current-copy pair.  It never changes published battery properties and
performs no PMIC writes.  Without that boot argument this patch is inert.

